  <div class="prose">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Disclaimer</p>
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p>Pages here are for identification. They are not a repair manual, a pressure-vessel design, or a substitute for the plate on your machine.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>High-pressure water cuts skin and throws debris. Wear eye protection. Do not test a doubtful joint by starting the pump.</li>
      <li>Never exceed the PSI or temperature rating printed on a hose, gun, or adapter.</li>
      <li>Never defeat a thermal relief, unloader, or GFCI because a fitting leaked.</li>
      <li>Brand notes can be wrong for a given serial. Measure.</li>
      <li>We are not affiliated with the manufacturers named on the brand pages.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If a connection fights you, stop. Cross-threading an M22 nut is cheaper to avoid than to explain.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
